flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Login / Register with OTP]
    B --> C{Valid credentials?}
    C -- No --> B
    C -- Yes --> D{Is administrator?}
    D -- Yes --> Z1([Admin Console / Exit])
    D -- No --> RD{Authorised to raise?}
    RD -- Manager --> Z2([Manage complaints only / Exit])

    RD -- Employee --> E[Report a Problem]
    E --> F{Validate complaint data}
    F -- Invalid --> E
    F -- Valid --> G[Create complaint - status PENDING - staff unassigned]
    G --> H[Manager reviews complaint]
    H --> I[Assign maintenance staff]
    I --> J{Move to IN_PROGRESS?}
    J -- No, staff unassigned --> H
    J -- Yes, staff assigned --> K[Set status = IN_PROGRESS]
    K --> L[Set / adjust priority]
    L --> M{Resolution ready?}
    M -- No --> L
    M -- Yes --> N[Add resolution remarks]
    N --> O{Remarks present?}
    O -- No --> N
    O -- Yes --> P[Set status = RESOLVED - resolved_at recorded]
    P --> Q[Employee views updated status and history]
    Q --> R([End / Logout])